---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy - 1DAY">
  <div class="legal-page">
    <header class="legal-header">
      <a href="/" class="header-logo">1DAY</a>
    </header>
    
    <main class="legal-content">
      <h1 class="legal-title">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="legal-updated">Last updated: December 2024</p>
      
      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>1. Introduction</h2>
        <p>
          This Privacy Policy explains how 1DAY ("we", "our", or "the Service") collects, uses, 
          and protects your information when you use our habit tracking application.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>2. Information We Collect</h2>
        <h3>Account Information</h3>
        <p>When you sign in with Google, we receive:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Your email address</li>
          <li>Your display name</li>
          <li>Your profile picture (if available)</li>
        </ul>
        
        <h3>Habit Data</h3>
        <p>We store the data you create:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Habit names and icons you create</li>
          <li>Dates when you mark habits as complete</li>
          <li>Streak history and statistics</li>
        </ul>

        <h3>Usage Data</h3>
        <p>
          We may collect anonymized usage data to improve the Service, such as feature usage patterns 
          and error reports. This data cannot be used to identify you personally.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>3. How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <p>We use your information to:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Provide and maintain the Service</li>
          <li>Sync your habit data across devices</li>
          <li>Display your profile information within the app</li>
          <li>Send important service-related notifications</li>
          <li>Improve and develop new features</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>4. Data Storage and Security</h2>
        <p>
          Your data is stored securely using Supabase, which provides enterprise-grade security 
          including encryption at rest and in transit. We implement appropriate technical and 
          organizational measures to protect your personal information.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>5. Data Sharing</h2>
        <p>We do not sell your personal information. We may share data only:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>With service providers who help operate the Service (e.g., Supabase for data storage)</li>
          <li>When required by law or to protect our legal rights</li>
          <li>In aggregated, anonymized form for analytics purposes</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>6. Your Rights</h2>
        <p>You have the right to:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Access your personal data stored in the Service</li>
          <li>Update or correct your profile information</li>
          <li>Delete your account and associated data</li>
          <li>Export your habit data</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          To exercise these rights, please contact us through the application or sign out and 
          request account deletion.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>7. Cookies and Local Storage</h2>
        <p>
          We use browser local storage to maintain your authentication session and improve 
          performance. This is essential for the Service to function and cannot be disabled.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>8. Third-Party Services</h2>
        <p>The Service uses the following third-party services:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Google Sign-In:</strong> For authentication (subject to Google's Privacy Policy)</li>
          <li><strong>Supabase:</strong> For data storage and authentication infrastructure</li>
          <li><strong>Vercel:</strong> For hosting and content delivery</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>9. Children's Privacy</h2>
        <p>
          The Service is not intended for children under 13 years of age. We do not knowingly 
          collect personal information from children under 13.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>10. Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p>
          We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. We will notify you of any changes 
          by updating the "Last updated" date. We encourage you to review this policy periodically.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>11. Contact Us</h2>
        <p>
          If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy or our data practices, please 
          contact us through the application.
        </p>
      </section>

      <div class="legal-nav">
        <a href="/" class="btn btn-secondary">Back to home</a>
        <a href="/terms" class="legal-link">Terms of Service</a>
      </div>
    </main>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .legal-page {
    min-height: 100vh;
    padding: 2rem 1rem;
  }

  .legal-header {
    max-width: 48rem;
    margin: 0 auto 3rem;
  }

  .legal-content {
    max-width: 48rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .legal-title {
    font-size: 2rem;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: white;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
  }

  .legal-updated {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .legal-section {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .legal-section h2 {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: white;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .legal-section h3 {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    margin: 1rem 0 0.5rem;
  }

  .legal-section p {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .legal-section ul {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0.75rem 0;
  }

  .legal-section li {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.7;
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
    position: relative;
    margin-bottom: 0.375rem;
  }

  .legal-section li::before {
    content: "•";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .legal-nav {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin-top: 3rem;
    padding-top: 2rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .legal-link {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 150ms ease;
  }

  .legal-link:hover {
    color: white;
  }
</style>

